      "content": "The aldehydes which will not form Grignard product with one equivalent Grignard reagents are - \n<br><br><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/6MlwjiiiTaVxM5QQm/J8vg4x2hP90ff3eDRTQSem3SoHDHh/L5FFkOzeGZAT8l5eRlcIze/image.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;  height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 12th January Evening Slot Chemistry - Aldehydes, Ketones and Carboxylic Acids Question 231 English\">",
